   "detailed_description": "<h1>《NBA 2K27》豪華版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/58577a08cf1ef76a0bc0bf24269fd8f9.avif?t=1792163139\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此版本內含：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  100,000 VC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>MyTEAM（所有卡片與卡包均不可拍賣）：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ‘27完整陣容：第1系列球隊選拔</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 三重威脅公園自由球員卡包</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5x ‘27：系列1卡包</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2小時2倍經驗值幣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>MyCAREER：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 25x 6種技能增強</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 25x 3種Gatorade增強</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2小時2倍經驗值幣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Victor Wembanyama球衣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Caitlin Clark球衣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 快速比賽、MyNBA和The W有離線模式。所有其他遊戲模式與功能都需要網際網路連線、可能需要在線上註冊帳號，而且所有使用者未必隨時都能使用。</p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/c6dd70b9ca5c522b3879fbe2c00832a0.avif?t=1792163139\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/6e7162c9f8aa29eb509e4bccc75a51be.poster.avif?t=1792163139\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/6e7162c9f8aa29eb509e4bccc75a51be.webm?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/6e7162c9f8aa29eb509e4bccc75a51be.mp4?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《NBA 2K27》拼勁不減，征途永無止境。在 MyCAREER*、MyTEAM 和 MyNBA 時時刻刻追求卓越，讓心中偉大的籃球夢成真。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/62b00f87c0302cd68e184f44b1f235b9.poster.avif?t=1792163139\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/62b00f87c0302cd68e184f44b1f235b9.webm?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/62b00f87c0302cd68e184f44b1f235b9.mp4?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>籃球之城</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 扛起籃球之城，帶領新世代的 MyPLAYER，代表每位熱愛籃球的球員，憑著對籃球的熱情奮力出擊。用熱情在球場內外活出獨一無二的風格，前往隊伍總部揪好友組隊，稱霸籃球中心與公園等各大球場。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/e1f900c2891216c8e046014e5dd79ef1.poster.avif?t=1792163139\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/e1f900c2891216c8e046014e5dd79ef1.webm?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/e1f900c2891216c8e046014e5dd79ef1.mp4?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MyCAREER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MyCAREER 首度讓你橫跨 NBA 歷史，與來自 5 個經典年代的傳奇球星一較高下，並在現代篇章中體驗一段足以定義生涯傳奇的故事。打造突破既有打法的 MyPLAYER，在邁向名人堂的路上改寫紀錄。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/8c0c9305126d107ca8cb1dff3e3da1a5.poster.avif?t=1792163139\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/8c0c9305126d107ca8cb1dff3e3da1a5.webm?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/8c0c9305126d107ca8cb1dff3e3da1a5.mp4?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ProPLAY®技術支援</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 直接取材自真實 NBA 賽事的全新遊戲動畫，讓你的球技更上層樓。善用各式各樣的ProPLAY®功能，包括用刁鑽的交叉運球過人將防守者耍得團團轉，利用增強的投籃機制展現射程，並且在每次踏上球場時成為對手最難纏的對位惡夢。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/7bf2c068785f196f7119245a4f105235.poster.avif?t=1792163139\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/7bf2c068785f196f7119245a4f105235.webm?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356430/extras/7bf2c068785f196f7119245a4f105235.mp4?t=1792163139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MyTEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 輕鬆收集最愛的NBA與WNBA球星，打造留名青史的夢幻球隊。擴充你的收藏，組合出無數種不同陣容。掌控你的 MyTEAM，並在單人與多人模式中接受考驗，挑戰內容皆取材自 NBA 賽場上的精彩表現。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>*若要兌換及使用追加內容，必須有網際網路連線與《NBA 2K》帳號。須遵守相關條款。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> 快速比賽、MyNBA和The W有離線模式。所有其他遊戲模式與功能都需要網際網路連線、可能需要在線上註冊帳號，而且所有使用者未必隨時都能使用</i></p>",
