   "pc_requirements": {
    "minimum": "<strong>最低配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位元的處理器及作業系統<br></li><li><strong>作業系統:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-9400 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> 8 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 5 GB or AMD Radeon™ RX 5500 XT 4 GB or Intel® Arc™ A580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：12<br></li><li><strong>網路:</strong> 寬頻網際網路連線<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 110 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>備註:</strong> SSD Required. Dual-analog Gamepad recommended. Initial installation requires one-time internet connection for Steam authentication; software installations required (included with the game) include DirectX and Visual C++ Redistributable 2019. In order to play NBA 2K27 on PC, you need a processor capable of supporting AVX2 and a graphics card capable of supporting DirectX feature level 12.0.</li></ul>",
    "recommended": "<strong>建議配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位元的處理器及作業系統<br></li><li><strong>作業系統:</strong> Windows 11 64-Bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-10600 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> 16 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® RTX 2070 8 GB or AMD Radeon™ RX 5700 8 GB or Intel® Arc™ A770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：12<br></li><li><strong>網路:</strong> 寬頻網際網路連線<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 110 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>備註:</strong> SSD Required. Dual-analog Gamepad recommended. Initial installation requires one-time internet connection for Steam authentication; software installations required (included with the game) include DirectX and Visual C++ Redistributable 2019. In order to play NBA 2K27 on PC, you need a processor capable of supporting AVX2 and a graphics card capable of supporting DirectX feature level 12.0.</li></ul>"
